// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P4009585916" "Ungh..."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P2812713321" "No..."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3387632201" "Quiet.  The less you struggle, the easier the transformation."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P1176044470" "Don't think anyone is coming to help you.  Dockside is our domain."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P3721487702" "If the noises continue, the gag goes back in."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE__TEXT :
"P446063556" "A fine catch.  No one will miss this one."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ATTACK__TEXT :
"P4177831429" "Interruptions!  Unacceptable!  Get them!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ATTACK__TEXT :
"P9640690" "Your bad timing could get you killed."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ATTACK__TEXT :
"P197195379" "This one is ours!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1170553756" "Dockside will be ours!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2100940976" "Nice swipe, ace, now let me try."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3492016221" "I wouldn't get too comfortable here if I were you!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1069321630" "I could stand still if it will help you land a hit!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3964125513" "Is that all you got?  Go back to Villa Montrose!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3184657533" "Outsiders are not welcome, meat!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P778002201" "Oh look, fresh meat!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2028721310" "I'll deal with you later. This one's mine."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P74045167" "Ah, smaller fish to fry.  You and me.  Now."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P317510161" "You took a wrong turn.  This ain't Atlas Park, meat."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2415344551" "You...will...not...interfere!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P616259817" "How much more can your brain take?  Let's find out."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2831062617" "A present, from my bat to you."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2887302532" "That was a mistake, meat."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2291551476" "You walked in on the wrong fight, meat."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1867103844" "This bat's for you."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERBLUNT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3217317367" "I haven't snapped a bat in a while.  Come here, meat."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1751492437" "Welcome to my blade, poacher!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3082321087" "Get out of Dockside or this blade will do more than slice your skin!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2871230547" "Poaching on our turf comes with a price.  A very sharp price."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1852493241" "New flesh for the blade.  How sweet."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1875596390" "The meat keeps coming.  Time to butcher."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P644993840" "We'll talk later.  This one is mine!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERKNIFE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2289780602" "You're clearly new or you wouldn't be down here!  Get 'em!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2488274509" "Dockside WILL NOT be shared!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1348450848" "I can do this all day.  There is no compromise!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3471633046" "The docks aren't big enough for all of us!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2167279763" "You just stepped in on the wrong disagreement, meat!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3352480004" "The path to enlightenment is pain.  Let me educate you."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTERLOW_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1619858445" "You just made a big mistake."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2512572077" "One day we'll move off the docks and take over some Family turf."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1417720203" "Cold day today."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P323765583" "Bit of a cold snap coming off the water."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P530681424" "We're still on for the grab tomorrow, right?"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1017345692" "Shhh...keep it down, people could be listening."

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4143092434" "I told you someone was listening!  Get them!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4224903855" "We don't share!"
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P906275926" "Get your own barrel!"

// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2155653233" "This meal is beneath us, considering what we are destined for."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4127891573" "Rats.  Again."
// OAKES_DOCKSIDE_WARMHANDS_RATFRY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P815964668" "Pickings are slim."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3631517038" "S-Stop..."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_NPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P952909429" "My head..."


// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2989521140" "Take care of it!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3471736146" "This is not your place!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3889348715" "No!  Stop them!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P485936114" "We bide our time."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2662694246" "We know what we are destined for.  This is temporary."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_WARMHANDS_BARREL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P793879955" "We'll plan another raid for tomorrow evening.  We need more people."


